            "review_title": "Review at Pizza Pazzi",
            "review_text": "Lee Cat - 正黎\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam26 contributions\n0\nPazzi\nApr 2025 • Solo\n🔵 Dishes:\nTexas pizza is great +\nBefore, the cheese here was inflexible, but now they fixed that and can pull the cheese into very long strings +\n\n🔴 料理：\nテキサスピザがうまい +\n以前は、ここのチーズは柔軟性がなかったのですが、今では店がそれを直し、チーズを非常に長い紐状に引っ張ることができるようになった ＋\n\n🟡 Ẩm thực:\nPizza Texas hòa vị +\nCó đợt phô mai không được dẻo, giờ đã khắc phục, kéo sợi rất dài +\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 19, 2025",
